00:58:23.330 --> 00:58:34.020
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight for our show by our boss, Mr. Torey Malatia, who says it was just one thing that he did not know was inevitably going to be part of running any big public radio station.
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ对我们节目的管理监督来自我们的老板托里·马拉蒂亚先生，他说这只是他不知道会成为运营任何大型公共广播电台必然组成部分的一件事。

00:58:34.020 --> 00:58:41.950
<v Gregory Deloatch>Celibacy. That was the biggest thing. I didn't think about it.
<v Gregory Deloatch>“禁欲。那是最大的一件事。我完全没想过。”

00:58:41.950 --> 00:58:54.620
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周回来带来更多《美国生活》的故事。

00:58:54.620 --> 00:58:59.620
